<title>EGYPT: Egypt overall index rises to tenth record high.</title>
<headline>Egypt overall index rises to tenth record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index broke its tenth straight record high on Thursday, rising 2.29 points, or 0.62 percent, to close at 372.18 points, the Capital Market Authority said.</p>
<p>Wednesday's, the ninth record high, close was 369.89.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
